ut one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nOn Friday afternoon, in the school library, Xiao Li is reading a magazine attentively. Xiao Gang and Xiao Xue sit on the table next to her, they are also Xiao Li's classmates. Xiao Gang suddenly says to Xiao Xue: \"Do you know Xiao Li comes here to read magazines every day? I think she is a bit unusual.\" At this moment, Xiao Li hears their conversation, quietly closes the magazine, and prepares to leave. Xiao Xue continues to say: \"Yes, she always sits here alone, seems very focused.\" Xiao Li feels a bit surprised, but still says friendly: \"Hmm, I am particularly interested in this magazine.\" Xiao Gang and Xiao Xue laugh, then Xiao Xue asks: \"Xiao Li, are you going to participate in the school's poetry recitation competition now?\"\n\n[Question]\nWhere does the story take place?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Park\nB. Supermarket\nC. Classroom\nD. Library","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af58ecf9aa9dc5a833d634b","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794477775434,"createTime":"2026-11-12 18:02:55","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"48f256898fd34c49a3af6aca10403ddf"}